{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ABOUT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Snuggle up with <strong>Storytime Cats - Meows and Mistletoes</strong> for a heartwarming adventure, and discover the cutest cats tucked away in cozy Christmas scenes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653420/extras/6a311fd6879110af9c238af65b1213c3.poster.avif?t=1746121601\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653420/extras/6a311fd6879110af9c238af65b1213c3.webm?t=1746121601\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653420/extras/6a311fd6879110af9c238af65b1213c3.mp4?t=1746121601\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf84 Cozy Holiday Scenes<strong>:</strong> Explore 7 cozy Christmas settings, from twinkling snow-covered streets to warm, glowing fireplaces and charming festive villages.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc31 Adorable Hidden Cats<strong>:</strong> Find playful cats tucked away in the most delightful nooks and crannies!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653420/extras/14f99d06d94cdbb88c86def5c2f8bb32.avif?t=1746121601\" width=616 height=352 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2615 Grab a cup of cocoa, relax, and join your cat friends in the festivities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3653420?t=1746121601","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/